# Script — "The Paper Lantern" (no dialogue)

Running time: 20.0 s (allowed 18–22 s). Timecodes are targets; the editor may move a cut point by up to ±0.5 s for rhythm, keeping the total in 19–21 s.

**00:00.0–00:02.0 — TITLE.** Out of black, the words *The Paper Lantern* appear over a deep dusk-blue ground (or a soft blurred plate of the dusk river). Water and evening ambience fade in under it; the first notes of the music cue.

